@page
@model iD_Develops.Pages.LanguageAndCommunication.Communication.iDeasModel
@inject Microsoft.Extensions.Localization.IStringLocalizer<iD_Develops.Pages.LanguageAndCommunication.Communication.iDeasModel> Localizer
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = Localizer["Title"];
}

<section class="public-page">
    <div class="public-container public-legal">
        <p class="public-eyebrow public-eyebrow-left">@Localizer["Eyebrow"]</p>
        <h1 class="public-page-title">@Localizer["Heading"]</h1>
        <article>
            <p>@Localizer["Blog1Label"] <b>@Localizer["Blog1Title"]</b></p>
            <p>@Localizer["Blog1Paragraph1"]</p>
            <p>@Localizer["Blog1Paragraph2"]</p>
            <p>@Localizer["Blog1Paragraph3"]</p>
            <p>@Localizer["Blog1Paragraph4"]</p>
            <p>@Localizer["Blog1SignOff"]</p>
            <p>Dominique</p>
            <p>@Localizer["Blog1Postscript"]</p>
        </article>
        <article class="mt-12">
            <p>@Localizer["Blog2Label"] <b>@Localizer["Blog2Title"]</b></p>
            <p>@Localizer["Blog2Paragraph1"]</p>
            <p>@Localizer["Blog2Paragraph2"]</p>
            <p>@Localizer["Blog2Paragraph3"]</p>
            <p>@Localizer["Blog2Paragraph4"]</p>
            <p>@Localizer["Blog2Paragraph5"]</p>
            <p>@Localizer["Blog2SignOff"]</p>
            <p>Dominique</p>
        </article>
    </div>
</section>
